# Push a change to this file to run a backtest without the GitHub connector.
# Format: one line, "MODE [MONTHS]". Lines starting with # are ignored.
# The mode must also be in the fetch-step whitelist in backtest.yml.
#
# v86bt: the sleeve split the owner asked for — 70% of capital sits in ROTA on
# the strength of a figure the PR #21 funding fix showed was inflated. Behind a
# NOISE FLOOR first: v85bt's uniform sweep zigzagged 36/68/33/70/1% across
# adjacent settings, so the instrument's error bar must be measured (by
# perturbing starting cash, which cannot matter) before any row is read.
v86bt 36
